# Single source for docs/FEATURES.md and the published feature-matrix page (docs/features/feature-matrix.html).
# Edit here, then run: python3 docs/features/build.py   (regenerates both files; republish the page afterwards).
# Rows: (feature, status, notes[, next]).
# status: ok (working) / part (in progress) / todo (not started) / out (not planned)
# notes: 1-3 sentences, today's evidence only (rehearsal / kit id + the key number); history belongs in WORKLOG.
# next: one or more items, each starting with a prefix: "Fixing:", "Add:", "Tune:", "Owner check:" or "Nothing".
#   Several items are separated by "; " and each starts with its prefix (build.py lists them in the summary).
#   A source in parentheses: upstream, tb323fu (Lenovo Legion Tab Gen 5), SuperTurtleDev, or our own idea.

